  "body": "I have setup matrix with Ansible, quite straightforward setup, but have a couple of issues.\r\n\r\nFirst when talking with a person on discord that also have a Matrix account, Matrix is creating new rooms randomly. This is just happening with the user that also have a matrix account. How is it possible to stop this? See screenshot \r\n\r\nAlso all the online stats is grey, even if the user status say online.\r\n\r\nThird is it possible to have a notification in the room where someone is typing? (For example “aleks typing…”\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_2023-06-23-12-31-09-46](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/assets/3678663/ec3f75b4-bdda-4aac-91f9-b78e132fb574)\r\n",
